    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph_number": 229,
      "text": "All fixed models used the original 312-patient development set with ALBI, FIB-4, INR and PLT in the saved learner order. The saved positive class for the six original models is Yes. Tuning used development data only, without validation- or external-dependent retuning. Glmnet standardization and SVM scaling are saved training transformations; unspecified preprocessing is retained as unspecified.",
      "display_html": "All fixed models used the original 312-patient development set with ALBI, FIB-4, INR and PLT in the saved learner order. The saved positive class for the six original models is Yes. Tuning used development data only, without validation- or external-dependent retuning. Glmnet standardization and SVM scaling are saved training transformations; unspecified preprocessing is retained as unspecified."
    },
    {
